              "type": "code_execution_result",
              "stdout": "<class 'str'>\n[{\"type\": \"web_search_result\", \"title\": \"Best International Schools in Bangkok 2025\\u20132026\", \"url\": \"https://www.tutopiya.com/blog/international-school-fees/best-international-schools-bangkok/\", \"content\": \"Bangkok Patana School: British (IGCSE, A-Level). Long-established. \\u00b7 **NIST International School**: IB. Non-profit ethos. \\u00b7 **Ruamrudee International School (RIS)**: American and IB. Good facilities. \\u2026 KIS International School: IB. Value-focused.\\n\\nBest international schools in Bangkok: ISB, Shrewsbury, Bangkok Patana, NIST, Bromsgrove and more. Curricula, fees and how to choose.\\n\\n# Best International Schools in Bangkok 2025\\u20132026\\n## Best International Schools in Bangkok\\n### Premium tier (THB 650,000\\u20131,000,000+ per year)\\n- **International School Bangkok (ISB):** American and IB. Extensive facilities.\\n- **Shrewsbury International School Bangkok:** British (IGCSE, A-Level). Sister to Shrewsbury UK.\\n- **Bromsgrove International School Thailand:** British. Strong academic focus.\\n\\n### Mid-tier (THB 400,000\\u2013600,000 per year)\\n- **Bangkok Patana School:** British (IGCSE, A-Level). Long-established.\\n- **NIST International School:** IB. Non-profit ethos.\\n- **Ruamrudee International School (RIS):** American and IB. Good facilities.\\n\\n### Budget tier (THB 200,000\\u2013350,000 per year)\\n- **Wells International School:** British and American. Affordable.\\n- **KIS International School:** IB. Value-focused.\\n- **St Andrews International School (Sathorn):** British. Central location.\", \"page_age\": \"294 days ago\"}, {\"type\": \"web_search_result\", \"title\": \"Top 10 Best International Schools in Bangkok 2026\", \"url\": \"https://www.thailandprivilege.co.th/why-thailand/best-international-schools-bangkok\", \"content\": \"**International School Bangkok (ISB)** \\u2026 4. **KIS International School Reignwood Park** \\u2026 8. British Columbia International School Bangkok\\n\\n# Best International Schools in Bangkok for Expat Children\\n## The 10 Best International Schools in Bangkok for Expat Families\\nThe schools listed below represent a cross section of the best schools in Bangkok for expats, selected across curricula, age range, and community profile.\\n\\nInternational School Bangkok (ISB)**\\n\\nISB is one of Bangkok's oldest and most established international schools, consistently recognized for its academic rigor, extensive extracurricular programs, and large, diverse student community drawn from over 50 nationalities.\\n\\nRegent's International School Bangkok**\\n\\nSt Andrew's International School Bangkok**\\n\\nKIS International School Reignwood Park**\\n\\nGarden International School Bangkok**\\n\\nAustralian International School Bangkok (AISB)**\\n\\nRIS Swiss Section, Deutschsprachige Schule Bangkok**\\n\\nBritish Columbia International School Bangkok**\\n\\nBangkok Christian International School**\\n\\nNIST International School Bangkok**\\n\\nNIST is widely regarded as one of Bangkok's premier IB schools, with a strong emphasis on internation\n",
